window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A demi-goddess with the power over life and death, the God of the Underworld burning for revenge . . . it's a forbidden obsession waiting to happen.</p> <p>Hades is ready to take the fight to the gang Pithos who keep pissing him off and messing with his business. When a money trail leads back to Demeter, Queen of Athens, he takes the one thing she values; her daughter Persephone.</p> <p>Persephone is no pampered princess. With a curse to create life in one hand and control death with the other, she's going to make life Hell for her kidnapper.</p> <p>Hades is willing to play dirty to get what he wants, but he's about to meet his match in the irresistible demi-goddess who only plays to win.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
